[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16500.949, "timestamp": "04:35:00", "text": "食物。我的HP是50。武器。拿到它们。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16505.51, "timestamp": "04:35:05", "text": "开始了。我也需要一些HP。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16508.629, "timestamp": "04:35:08", "text": "呃，你可以吃东西。坚持，稍等。呃，哪里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16511.75, "timestamp": "04:35:11", "text": "你在哪里？呃，我就简单地说一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16513.269, "timestamp": "04:35:13", "text": "把食物放在这里。我把食物拿走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16515.83, "timestamp": "04:35:15", "text": "好的，谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16519.75, "timestamp": "04:35:19", "text": "等等，我不能吃种子。为什么？不。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16521.75, "timestamp": "04:35:21", "text": "是的。你是爱吃肉的。我忘了这件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16523.59, "timestamp": "04:35:23", "text": "那。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16526.39, "timestamp": "04:35:26", "text": "你不能吃任何不像我的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16527.83, "timestamp": "04:35:27", "text": "我的意思是，我能吃到怪物肉，但那只是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16530.789, "timestamp": "04:35:30", "text": "我觉得这会让你死的。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16533.75, "timestamp": "04:35:33", "text": "不是制作波浪号的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16535.59, "timestamp": "04:35:35", "text": "是啊，我们该怎么称呼它呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16537.349, "timestamp": "04:35:37", "text": "最后每个人都给我送心形图案。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16540.869, "timestamp": "04:35:40", "text": "时间。现在我送的是爱心。我猜"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16542.949, "timestamp": "04:35:42", "text": "轮到你了，因为我他妈的做不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16546.15, "timestamp": "04:35:46", "text": "拉屎。我进度落后了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16548.31, "timestamp": "04:35:48", "text": "最后，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16549.99, "timestamp": "04:35:49", "text": "我会把这事搞砸的。但最终，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16552.15, "timestamp": "04:35:52", "text": "有用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16554.23, "timestamp": "04:35:54", "text": "看来只能把我的东西拿来了。我从中学到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16558.23, "timestamp": "04:35:58", "text": "你。你以我为荣吗？我来了。"}]